      "writtenOn": "2019-10-30T15:35:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Error response is also sent if requested contact is blacklisted. In new API, we don\u0027t see any parameter to specify if requested contact is blacklisted. Just wanted to understand how do we handle such a case. It is part of existing AIDL Option API.\n\nresponseIncomingOptions(int optionsServiceHandle,  int tId, int sipResponseCode,\n                                   String reasonPhrase, in OptionsCapInfo capInfo,\n                                       in boolean bContactInBL);",
      "revId": "c2a60b20bca9e67c1d0e453717f6c5c0c0a6ad38",
